# .npmrc — pnpm configuration for the OTUA Protocol monorepo.
#
# Pre-approves native packages that require compilation so pnpm install
# never prompts interactively. All four are legitimate build dependencies:
#   @nestjs/core     — NestJS API framework (native optimisations)
#   esbuild          — bundler used by Vitest and NestJS build toolchain
#   sharp            — image processing used by Next.js image optimisation
#   unrs-resolver    — Rust-based module resolver used by ESLint/oxc tooling
#
# pnpm 12 stores the approval in the lockfile after `pnpm approve-builds --all`
# has been run. This file documents the decision for contributors.
